<disclaimer-bar/><view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="title">我的理性购彩计划</view><view class="subtitle">预算是提醒，不是建议花完的额度</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section">预算设置</view><view class="field"><view class="label">月预算（元，0表示不安排支出）</view><input type="digit" value="{{monthly}}" data-key="monthly" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><view class="label">单期累计上限（元）</view><input type="digit" value="{{perIssue}}" data-key="perIssue" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="save">保存预算</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section">策略预设</view><view class="muted">在选号页调整参数后保存，在这里加载。</view><view wx:if="{{!presets.length}}" class="empty">暂无策略预设</view><view wx:for="{{presets}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="row"><button class="small secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="load">加载并选号</button><button class="small secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="generate">设置并保存新策略</button></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="section">超限日志 · {{logs.length}} 条</view><text class="link" bindtap="logs">{{showLogs?'收起':'查看'}}</text></view><block wx:if="{{showLogs}}"><view wx:if="{{!logs.length}}" class="empty">暂无超限操作</view><view wx:for="{{logs}}" wx:key="id" class="record"><view>{{item.action}} · {{item.issue}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.time}} · ¥{{item.amount}}</view><view class="danger">{{item.reasonText}}</view></view></block></view><view class="card"><view class="section">关于彩票选号助手</view><view class="subtitle">colourtickchoosetool · 合规 MVP<br/>AI 辅助为本地规则与随机筛选，不连接预测模型。筛号≠预测、中奖属偶然、不提升中奖概率。禁止代售，不售票、不支付、不承诺收益。</view><view class="divider"/><view class="subtitle">未成年人勿用、理性购彩。只使用可承受损失的娱乐预算，勿借贷、勿追损。若购彩影响生活，请暂停并向亲友或专业机构寻求帮助。</view><view class="footer">数据仅存本机，无后端、无账号。模拟开奖非官方实时数据。清除小程序数据会丢失账本、预设与日志。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="notice">查看使用须知</button></view></view>
